summary:
  The stand watch treats a ringing alarm's station like any other.

history:
  Bench, 2026-11-12: an alarm's station held its connection and sent
  nothing 8 s into the wake-up. The rule that makes an alarm's
  third silence known as fast as its first is of no use if the watch never
  asks whether an alarm rings: every verdict doubles the wait.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
          var waking = app._alarmRings(nowMs) === true;

replace:
          var waking = false;

expect:
  Killed by tst_standwatch::test_while_an_alarm_rings_every_silence_is_known_as_fast_as_the_first.
  Line-neutral.
